'''Russell Scott Swan''' (born March 30, 1963) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[linebacker]] in the [[National Football League]] (NFL) for the [[Dallas Cowboys]]. He played [[college football]] for the [[Virginia Cavaliers football|Virginia Cavaliers]].
